notes: >-
  Code is Apache-2.0; data (RunRecords, corpus, ground truth, grades) is
  CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA); registration prompts and forms (pre_registration/) are CC0.
  This is one versioned study release. The comparative campaign evaluated
  mlt-stack 1.0.0rc1. Retained fields were retrospectively inconsistent with
  the later result-state contract; the study checked the successor
  1.0.3-derived implementation on the frozen
  canonical conditions to determine whether blocking or insufficient
  specifications route to non-executable states.
references:
